  "description": "Rehman.DbSentinel is a professional embedded database monitoring and insights dashboard\n      for .NET applications. Supports .NET Core 2.1 through .NET 9 with advanced database\n      inspection capabilities including Monaco SQL Editor, schema explorer, audit/change tracking,\n      query diagnostics, and secure read-only database access.\n\n      Supported Databases:\n      - PostgreSQL\n      - Microsoft SQL Server\n      - SQLite\n\n      Designed for developers, administrators, and enterprise monitoring solutions.",
